        <mxCell id="flow-legend" value="Flow&#10;1. Verify (WebSocket)&#10;2. socket to lti-adapter&#10;3. lti submits Batch job&#10;4. Batch pulls ECR image&#10;5. Batch reads S3 task&#10;6. SRE-&gt;Rule Engine; KTM-&gt;EKS&#10;7. Signed callback to lti&#10;8. lti records grade (Atlas)&#10;9. lti writes logs to S3&#10;10. lti asks Bedrock summary&#10;11. lti pushes to WebSocket&#10;12. WebSocket to student" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
